<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Jan 10.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Jan 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feedwheat to North Yorkshire Jan 95.00</p>
<p>Yorks Feb 95.50 Apr/Jun 99.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Feb 96.00/95.50/95.25</p>
<p>Avon four Apr/Jun 99.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jan 95.00 Feb 96.00/96.50 Mar 97.00 Apr/Jun 99.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Jan 96.00</p>
<p>Shropshire Jan 94.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan 95.00</p>
<p>There were no barley or milling wheat trades reported.</p>
</text>
